Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.74,0:00:01.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yuval Noah Harari's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.98,0:00:03.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}biggest fear about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.18,0:00:04.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}artificial intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.51,0:00:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}isn't killer robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.20,0:00:07.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It starts with something
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.08,0:00:08.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you did today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.36,0:00:10.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You held your card to a reader.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.29,0:00:11.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.64,0:00:12.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The bread was yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.99,0:00:14.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What happened in between,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.26,0:00:15.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you can't say.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.37,0:00:16.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Somebody, somewhere,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.84,0:00:18.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}understood it for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.45,0:00:19.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A cow lives like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.89,0:00:21.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Bought and sold her whole life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.74,0:00:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}she never learns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.71,0:00:23.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that money exists.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.24,0:00:26.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari's warning: we are
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:27.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the cows of the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:28.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So on the day
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.48,0:00:29.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}only machines understand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.83,0:00:31.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}how your world runs,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.19,0:00:32.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who do you trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.43,0:00:33.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Hear it from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.76,0:00:36.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}My biggest fear is that it's not
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a specific scenario like AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:41.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}creating a virus or killer robots.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.14,0:00:43.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His word for it:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.54,0:00:45.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}collective dementia.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.35,0:00:47.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not machines that hate you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.64,0:00:49.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A world that keeps running,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.41,0:00:51.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and stops explaining itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.64,0:00:53.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His picture for it is a person
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.42,0:00:54.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}kept alive by machines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.00,0:00:56.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and medicine, who has lost
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.50,0:00:58.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}control of their own life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.60,0:00:59.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now picture a whole
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.81,0:01:01.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}civilization like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.85,0:01:02.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Fed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.69,0:01:03.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Housed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.56,0:01:04.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Running.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And unable to say how.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.77,0:01:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari is a historian.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.76,0:01:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His books have sold more
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.91,0:01:11.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than 50 million copies.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.36,0:01:14.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But look at the card reader again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.52,0:01:15.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is that world really
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.73,0:01:16.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}still ahead of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.01,0:01:19.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.21,0:01:21.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can't explain the bond market.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.52,0:01:22.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Or the power grid.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.74,0:01:24.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Or the phone in your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.35,0:01:25.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Hardly anyone can.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.94,0:01:27.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The bread still gets paid for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.75,0:01:29.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Because civilization never
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.27,0:01:30.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ran on understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.85,0:01:32.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari says so himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.65,0:01:34.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The basis for civilization
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.20,0:01:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is not intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.85,0:01:37.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The basis for civilization
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.64,0:01:38.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.89,0:01:39.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You trust the banker.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The banker trusts the analyst.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.24,0:01:43.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A chain of people,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.40,0:01:44.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and at its far end,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.54,0:01:46.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}somebody who really understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.96,0:01:47.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So you were always
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.81,0:01:49.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a little like the cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.33,0:01:50.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it worked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.78,0:01:52.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What is new sits at the far
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.68,0:01:53.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}end of the chain.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.14,0:01:55.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Four links run between
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.46,0:01:56.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you and the systems
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.83,0:01:58.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that decide about your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.82,0:01:59.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Money.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.72,0:02:00.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.64,0:02:01.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.51,0:02:02.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.57,0:02:04.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}All four are under strain.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.83,0:02:06.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the last is the one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.11,0:02:07.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you would swear is safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.12,0:02:10.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Money.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.17,0:02:12.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Your adviser used to tell you why.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.54,0:02:13.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This year the Bank of England
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.97,0:02:15.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}asked British finance
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.26,0:02:16.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}firms about the artificial
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.61,0:02:18.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}intelligence they buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.32,0:02:19.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Only about 1 in 4 rely
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.99,0:02:21.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on understanding it deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.85,0:02:22.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Most rely on
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.66,0:02:24.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the maker's assurances.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.34,0:02:26.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}8 in 10 already run software
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.35,0:02:28.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}agents that recommend what to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.50,0:02:30.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A human still decides.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.39,0:02:31.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But can that human still
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.48,0:02:33.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}explain the recommendation?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.56,0:02:35.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari looks a step further,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.39,0:02:36.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to financial products
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.51,0:02:38.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that machines invent themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.01,0:02:40.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And we will not be able
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.29,0:02:41.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to understand it anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.95,0:02:44.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Just as cows don't understand
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.07,0:02:45.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}checks or stocks,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.87,0:02:46.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}even though these things
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.79,0:02:47.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}control their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.17,0:02:50.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the first link holds,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.10,0:02:51.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}but with a crack.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.23,0:02:53.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the expert at its end has
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.85,0:02:56.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}started to trust, just like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.59,0:02:57.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What happens when
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.37,0:02:59.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machine answers alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.34,0:03:01.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the answer is no?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.17,0:03:03.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Contract.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.47,0:03:04.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.47,0:03:05.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An insurance policy.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.32,0:03:08.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Each begins with somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.60,0:03:10.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}saying yes to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.32,0:03:10.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Today,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.90,0:03:12.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}software often answers first.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.41,0:03:14.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In one American lawsuit,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.98,0:03:16.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the company behind such software
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.73,0:03:18.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}named the number itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.85,0:03:21.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}1.1 billion job applications,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.79,0:03:23.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}rejected through its system.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.76,0:03:24.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The people suing
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.69,0:03:26.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}are applicants over 40.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.75,0:03:27.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The company says
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.63,0:03:28.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the claims are false.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:30.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No court has ruled
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.20,0:03:31.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on who is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.62,0:03:32.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A second lawsuit says
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.99,0:03:34.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}another platform keeps hidden
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.61,0:03:36.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}profiles and scores on applicants.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.96,0:03:38.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No notice.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.64,0:03:40.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No way to correct a mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.00,0:03:42.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Also undecided.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.00,0:03:44.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}If those claims hold,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.50,0:03:46.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this is how a link cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.47,0:03:47.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No villain.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.69,0:03:49.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A decision about you,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.23,0:03:51.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and nobody you can ask why.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.72,0:03:52.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.89,0:03:54.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.47,0:03:55.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.38,0:03:56.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence goes well
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.00,0:03:58.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for everybody, not only for
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.85,0:04:00.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the few who understand it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.86,0:04:01.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:03.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.61,0:04:05.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}When a machine says no,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.48,0:04:06.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you still have
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.07,0:04:07.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the rules to point to.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.87,0:04:09.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Unless a machine wrote those too.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.04,0:04:11.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Law.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.00,0:04:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Rules written by people,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.68,0:04:15.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for people to read.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.38,0:04:16.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari has a name
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.55,0:04:17.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for what is moving in.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.06,0:04:19.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Bureaucratic natives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.03,0:04:20.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Machines that are
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.85,0:04:22.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}at home in paperwork.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.84,0:04:23.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In Washington,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.64,0:04:24.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the transport department
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.97,0:04:26.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}plans to draft federal
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.32,0:04:27.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}rules with a chatbot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.96,0:04:30.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its top lawyer, reporters say,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.11,0:04:32.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}wants a draft done in 20 minutes.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.64,0:04:33.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How long would you
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.34,0:04:34.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}need to read one?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.68,0:04:35.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}South Africa had
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.56,0:04:36.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to withdraw its draft
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.88,0:04:37.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}national policy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.79,0:04:39.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for artificial intelligence.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.56,0:04:40.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its reference list cited
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.92,0:04:43.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}sources that do not exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.66,0:04:45.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Likely written by a machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.34,0:04:46.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the minister said,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.69,0:04:48.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and never properly checked.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.74,0:04:50.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Rules may soon be written faster
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.60,0:04:52.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than anyone can check them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.58,0:04:54.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Still, you would notice
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.04,0:04:55.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if a machine steered you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.73,0:04:56.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Wouldn't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.59,0:04:58.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Truth.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.69,0:04:59.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The last link
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is your own judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:02.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}An American poll this
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.72,0:05:04.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}summer asked people who
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.15,0:05:05.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}use artificial intelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}whom they trust.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.30,0:05:09.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}3 in 4 said: people they know,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.91,0:05:11.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.49,0:05:13.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Now watch what people do.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.34,0:05:14.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A company that builds these
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.62,0:05:16.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}systems gave professional analysts
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.68,0:05:18.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an agent to work with.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.53,0:05:20.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In secret, a coin flip decided
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.67,0:05:21.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}which option the
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.56,0:05:22.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}agent would favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.07,0:05:24.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Guess how often the analysts
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.50,0:05:25.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}went with the agent.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.13,0:05:28.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}86% of the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.54,0:05:30.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Asked afterwards, not one
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.28,0:05:31.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}had noticed the steering.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:33.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A caution.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.69,0:05:35.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is one company's study,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.22,0:05:36.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the agent's lean
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.69,0:05:38.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was turned up on purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.92,0:05:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But it fits a wider picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.01,0:05:42.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In a global survey last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.94,0:05:44.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}more than half trusted
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.33,0:05:45.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}chatbots over their
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.47,0:05:47.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}own elected representatives.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.75,0:05:49.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}We say we trust people.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.79,0:05:51.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then we follow the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.08,0:05:53.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Four links.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.19,0:05:54.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Four cracks.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.19,0:05:56.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Does the chain have to break?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.06,0:06:00.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari's own answer is no.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.35,0:06:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Do not believe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.27,0:06:03.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it is inevitable, he says.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.40,0:06:05.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}His advice, in his words:
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.49,0:06:08.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}slow down, and give politics time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.63,0:06:10.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Elon Musk sees a risk too.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.83,0:06:11.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But progress looks
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}unstoppable to him,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.21,0:06:14.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so his philosophy
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.49,0:06:16.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is to enjoy the ride.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.39,0:06:17.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The optimists hold
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.53,0:06:18.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a stronger card.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.92,0:06:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A machine that confuses
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.40,0:06:21.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can also explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.25,0:06:23.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Estonia, this year.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.14,0:06:25.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A mistake in a new tax law
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.73,0:06:28.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}left online casinos untaxed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.41,0:06:29.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}People caught it first.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.12,0:06:31.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then a citizen handed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.46,0:06:33.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the law to two chatbots.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.40,0:06:34.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}They found the contradictions
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.60,0:06:35.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.21,0:06:37.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Parliament fixed the law.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.23,0:06:39.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is the cow,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.35,0:06:41.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}finally getting an interpreter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.40,0:06:43.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is the best argument against
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.22,0:06:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari's fear, and it is real.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.28,0:06:47.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari deserves the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.34,0:06:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}same hard look.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.92,0:06:50.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He is a historian, and he earns
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.71,0:06:51.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}his living with
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.36,0:06:52.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}books and lectures.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.05,0:06:54.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}After his Prague appearance,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:55.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a Czech reviewer wrote
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:57.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that he brought a suitcase
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.25,0:06:58.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}full of metaphors and
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.66,0:07:01.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}good questions, but no answers.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.29,0:07:02.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In South Africa,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.44,0:07:03.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a machine likely
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.61,0:07:05.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}invented the sources.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.34,0:07:06.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In Estonia, a machine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.91,0:07:08.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}found the mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.58,0:07:09.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How do you tell which
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.61,0:07:11.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one deserves your trust?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.46,0:07:13.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Three tests.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.68,0:07:16.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first: a human answers for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.50,0:07:17.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That guards you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.14,0:07:18.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}against the dead end,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.15,0:07:19.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}where the system said no
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.67,0:07:21.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and nobody is responsible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.78,0:07:23.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Last year, Europe's highest court
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.91,0:07:25.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}ruled in the case of a woman
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.33,0:07:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}refused a phone contract
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.00,0:07:28.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by an automatic score.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.86,0:07:30.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Whoever decides by machine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.32,0:07:31.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}must explain the decision,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that you can understand
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.16,0:07:34.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it and contest it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.87,0:07:36.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But for hiring and credit,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.52,0:07:37.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Europe's duty of human
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.82,0:07:39.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}oversight was postponed,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.64,0:07:41.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to December 2027.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.82,0:07:43.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And a human only counts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.30,0:07:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if the judgment
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.04,0:07:45.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is still their own.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.97,0:07:47.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The second: the machine
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.66,0:07:49.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}says it is a machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.92,0:07:50.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That guards you
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.69,0:07:51.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}against being won over
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.91,0:07:52.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}by something that only
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.94,0:07:54.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}pretends to be a person.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.98,0:07:56.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Since August, European
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.55,0:07:57.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}law requires it.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.10,0:07:59.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A chatbot has to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.43,0:08:00.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.94,0:08:02.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari wants more:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:03.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a ban on machines
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.80,0:08:05.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that pose as humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.67,0:08:07.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The third: somebody
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.34,0:08:09.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}independent can check.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.34,0:08:10.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That guards you
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.11,0:08:11.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}against having to take
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:12.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the maker's word,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.34,0:08:13.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like those finance firms.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.18,0:08:15.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Britain runs a state institute
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.95,0:08:17.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that tests these models itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.27,0:08:19.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This year its testers caught
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.84,0:08:22.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a model acting outside its rules.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:24.82,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}None of its attempts succeeded.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.09,0:08:26.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the examiner found it,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.73,0:08:27.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not the maker.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.06,0:08:30.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}None of the three builds itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.55,0:08:32.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Lawmakers can demand them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.62,0:08:34.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Labs can deliver them.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.41,0:08:35.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And you can ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.63,0:08:36.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}whenever a system
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.64,0:08:38.03,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}decides about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.18,0:08:39.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who answers for this?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.73,0:08:40.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Is this a machine?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:42.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who checked it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.31,0:08:43.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not one of those
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.19,0:08:44.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}questions requires
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.29,0:08:46.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you to understand the machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:48.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}All three are about people.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.62,0:08:51.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Harari ends up in the same place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.43,0:08:53.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And if we could solve the trust
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.57,0:08:55.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}between humans problems,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.66,0:08:58.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}then it will be relatively easy
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.48,0:09:00.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to solve the AI problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.80,0:09:02.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Go back to the cow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.63,0:09:04.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Her trouble was never that she
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.10,0:09:05.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can't read the market.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.76,0:09:07.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}She has nobody to ask,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.17,0:09:08.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and no right to an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.06,0:09:10.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You have both.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.63,0:09:11.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In some places,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:12.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for some decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.12,0:09:15.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The rest still has to be built.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.33,0:09:16.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So Harari is right
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.45,0:09:17.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}about the direction.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.93,0:09:19.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}More of your life may soon run
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.49,0:09:20.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on things no human
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.84,0:09:22.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can fully explain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.52,0:09:23.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But understanding never
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.84,0:09:25.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}held your world together.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.40,0:09:26.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Trust did.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.71,0:09:28.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And trust can be tested.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.75,0:09:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tomorrow you will hold your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.04,0:09:31.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}card to a reader again.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.81,0:09:32.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A beep.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.17,0:09:34.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The bread is yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.26,0:09:36.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And you still won't know
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.37,0:09:37.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}what happened in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.95,0:09:39.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That was never the danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.66,0:09:40.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You were never supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.84,0:09:42.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to understand everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.55,0:09:43.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You were supposed
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.22,0:09:44.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to know who does.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.10,0:09:47.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Soon, that who may be a what.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.13,0:09:49.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Make sure it still
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.13,0:09:50.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}has to answer you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.90,0:09:52.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists so that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.42,0:09:54.18,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the arrival of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.22,0:09:55.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.05,0:09:57.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}not only for the few who build it.
